  "content": "\n\n<div>\n<div style=\"margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/4zVxJZnJ9iM?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"100%\"></iframe></span></div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ol1Tcf8.png\" width=\"180\" height=\"60\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bclib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/paulevsGitch/BCLib/main/bclib_banner.png\" width=\"180\" height=\"60\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/kYuATbYbKW\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/2111/2111370.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://github.com/paulevsGitch/BetterEnd/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/25/25231.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.buymeacoffee.com%252fquiqueck\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.buymeacoffee.com/buttons/v2/default-yellow.png\" alt=\"請我喝杯咖啡\" width=\"217\" height=\"60\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>描述：</strong></span></p>\n<p>本模組在末地加入了新生物群系，並修改了現有群系。每個群系都有獨特的大氣環境、資源與生物。天空會呈現帶有紫色星雲與星辰的客製化景觀。所有群系都配有專屬的背景音樂、音效與特效，讓它們充滿生機且適合探索。BetterEnd 擁有自訂的末地世界生成器與主島的客製化結構。透過新生成器，島嶼將擁有不同的形狀、地形與海拔高度。島嶼內部還可發現藏有獨特資源的洞穴。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>特色功能：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>超過 24 個新生物群系（後續將持續新增）</li>\n<li>6 種新生物（部分具備群系變體）</li>\n<li>大量新方塊，包含 9 種木材與 7 種新石頭材質</li>\n<li>大量新物品，包含新型態的食物、工具、盔甲與武器</li>\n<li>全新機制如灌注儀式、鐵砧配方、末地工具進度系統等</li>\n<li>與其他模組的整合，例如為 BYG 生物群系新增 2 種子群系（1.16版）及對應的新植物</li>\n<li>自訂末地世界生成器（可設定），提供更多元的可能性</li>\n<li>針對方塊、物品、生物、附魔等眾多項目提供詳細設定</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>遊戲截圖：</strong></span></p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/317/161/2020-10-17_10.png\" width=\"417\" height=\"221\"></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/317/879/2020-10-21_17.png\" width=\"417\" height=\"221\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/330/861/2020-12-28_17.png\" width=\"417\" height=\"221\"></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/328/798/2020-12-20_21.png\" width=\"417\" height=\"221\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/324/921/2020-11-27_20.png\" width=\"417\" height=\"221\"></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/328/795/2020-12-20_21.png\" width=\"417\" height=\"221\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>玩家評論：</strong></strong></span></p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/97_AjrikgpE?wmode=transparent\" height=\"221\" width=\"417\"></iframe></span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/VEkIKbwwmB0?wmode=transparent\" height=\"221\" width=\"417\"></iframe></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>模組整合：</strong></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/282/25/64/64/637287701215436754.png\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/canvas-renderer\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/197/845/64/64/636895665884150904.png\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/patchouli-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/283/385/64/64/637292980729992711.png\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-youll-go-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/281/230/64/64/637284761944802812.png\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/colored-lights-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/392/890/64/64/637587622695448568.png\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>我們的其它模組：</strong></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betterend\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/471/575/64/64/637760294980874674.png\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bclib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/396/271/64/64/637595638220205053.png\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/infgen\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/271/438/64/64/637248195374592724.png\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/skyworld\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/265/428/64/64/637229325539187031.png\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eden-ring\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/528/386/64/64/637851066965542722.png\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wunderreich\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/521/221/64/64/637840028913935424.jpeg\"></a></p>",
